<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>about</title>
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('./partials/_navbar.ejs') %>
        <h1>About</h1>
        <section class="about">
            <h1>About Us</h1>

            <p>
                Welcome to our hotel booking platform, designed to make finding and
                booking the perfect hotel simple and convenient.
            </p>

            <p>
                Our platform allows users to explore hotels, view available room types,
                prices, facilities, and locations, and make reservations with ease.
                Users can also manage their reservations and keep track of their
                upcoming and previous stays in one place.
            </p>

            <h2>Our Goal</h2>

            <p>
                Our goal is to provide a smooth and user-friendly booking experience
                by bringing everything you need to plan your stay together in one
                platform.
            </p>

            <h2>What We Offer</h2>

            <ul>
                <li>Explore a variety of hotels and their available rooms.</li>
                <li>View room prices, capacities, and hotel facilities.</li>
                <li>Check hotel locations and nearby attractions.</li>
                <li>Make and manage hotel reservations easily.</li>
                <li>View upcoming, completed, and cancelled reservations.</li>
                <li>Discover the services and amenities available at each hotel.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                We are committed to making hotel booking easier, clearer, and more
                convenient for every traveler.
            </p>
        </section>

        <%- include('./partials/_footer.ejs') %>
</body>

</html>